# =========================================================
# Data — ignore raw/processed by default, but explicitly TRACK the
# shareable project datasets (FDA public data + the small gvkey crosswalk).
# Repo is PRIVATE — see note in the WRDS section below before adding more.
# =========================================================
data/raw/**
data/processed/**
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/raw/README.md
!data/processed/README.md

# --- Tracked datasets (allow-list; date wildcards cover future snapshots) ---
# FDA Data Dashboard compliance actions (full warning-letter history, FY2009+).
# Public U.S. government data — always shareable.
!data/raw/fda_compliance_actions_*.csv
!data/processed/fda_compliance_actions_*.csv
# Warning-letter <-> Compustat gvkey crosswalk and companion worklists.
# Compustat-DERIVED (gvkey + a few company names); kept out of any PUBLIC repo.
!data/processed/compliance_actions_gvkey_crosswalk_*.csv
!data/processed/compliance_actions_unmatched_*.csv
!data/processed/compliance_actions_fuzzy_candidates_*.csv
# (The script-01/02 website-snapshot families — fda_warning_letters_*,
#  warning_letter_* — were retired 2026-07-06 and are no longer allow-listed;
#  re-running those scripts keeps their outputs local-only.)

# Allow small reference tables in data/external/ but ignore large blobs
data/external/*.dta
data/external/*.parquet
data/external/*.feather
data/external/*.csv.gz
data/external/*.zip

# =========================================================
# WRDS / licensed extracts — never commit (not even to a private repo:
# WRDS redistribution terms prohibit it). The full Compustat master pulled
# by scripts/02 stays ignored here on purpose; collaborators regenerate it
# from WRDS. Do NOT add a negation for these.
# =========================================================
*.sas7bdat
*_crsp*
*_compustat*
*_ibes*
*_audit_analytics*
compustat_*
data/raw/compustat_*

# =========================================================
# Output — keep tables/figures, ignore intermediate logs
# =========================================================
output/logs/**
!output/logs/.gitkeep
output/tables/*.tex.aux
output/tables/*.log
output/**/*.tmp

# =========================================================
# Literature PDFs — track .bib, ignore PDFs (copyright)
# =========================================================
literature/**/*.pdf
!literature/**/*.bib
!literature/README.md

# =========================================================
# Python
# =========================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.egg-info/

# =========================================================
# R / Stata / LaTeX
# =========================================================
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj.user/
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.out
*.dvi
paper/**/*.pdf

# Allow the final compiled paper
!paper/manuscript.pdf
!paper/manuscript_*.pdf

# =========================================================
# OS / editor
# =========================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# =========================================================
# Secrets / credentials
# =========================================================
*.key
*.pem
.wrds_credentials
config.local.*

# --- Large / regenerable data pulls (2026-07-19) ---
# Excluded on size or licensing, NOT importance. All are reproducible:
#   MAUDE  -> script 11 --resume from the local stream cache (~1 min)
#   FDA raw-> scripts 10/13 re-download from openFDA (seconds)
#   Compustat -> scripts 12/14 re-pull from WRDS (licensed; never committed)
data/processed/part803_adverse_events_*.csv.gz
data/raw/fda_device_recalls_*.csv
data/raw/fda_device_enforcement_*.csv
data/raw/edgar_8k_candidates_*.csv
data/raw/compustat_funda_*.csv
data/processed/part806_corrections_removals_*.csv
data/processed/8k_all_classified_*.csv
